{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗一名近兩歲女童在家中廁所被熱水燙傷手，據了解，30歲印傭被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">女童母親在網上發布圖片，見到女童雙手紅腫並脫皮。送院檢查後，醫生判斷為二級燒傷，額頭也有瘀傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MAID-1330.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026A2j92MvIvS1787215015.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MAID-1330.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，女童昨日下午與三歲哥哥在家中，由印尼女傭照顧。印傭聲稱，在洗手盆放暖水予女童玩，未測試水溫前女童已將手放入，導致燙傷。警方以疏忽照顧兒童拘捕印傭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T08:52:23.324659+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}